              Java Program Starts
                     │
                     ▼
            JVM loads the class
                     │
                     ▼
        Static variables initialized
                     │
                     ▼
          Static blocks execute
          (only once, in order)
                     │
                     ▼
             main() executes
                     │
                     ▼
      ┌──────────────────────────┐
      │ Is a static method called?│
      └─────────────┬────────────┘
                    │ Yes
                    ▼
          Static method executes
                    │
                    ▼
             Return to main()
                    │
                    ▼
       Is an object being created?
                    │
                   Yes
                    ▼
        Instance variables get
          default values
                    │
                    ▼
          Instance initialization
             / instance blocks
                    │
                    ▼
            Constructor executes
                    │
                    ▼
           Object is initialized
                    │
                    ▼
      ┌──────────────────────────┐
      │ Is an instance method    │
      │ called on the object?    │
      └─────────────┬────────────┘
                    │ Yes
                    ▼
          Instance method executes
                    │
                    ▼
             Return to main()
                    │
                    ▼
         Create another object?
               /          \
             Yes           No
              │             │
              └───→         ▼
                       main() ends
                           │
                           ▼
                      Program ends

Example :- 
class Student {

    // 1. Static variable
    static int count = 10;

    // 2. Static block
    static {
        System.out.println("2. Static Block");
    }

    // 3. Instance variable
    int age = 20;

    // 4. Instance block
    {
        System.out.println("4. Instance Block");
    }

    // 5. Constructor
    Student() {
        System.out.println("5. Constructor");
    }

    // 6. Static method
    static void displayCount() {
        System.out.println("3. Static Method");
    }

    // 7. Instance method
    void displayAge() {
        System.out.println("6. Instance Method");
    }
}

class Main {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        System.out.println("1. Main Method");

        Student.displayCount();

        Student s1 = new Student();
        s1.displayAge();

        Student s2 = new Student();
        s2.displayAge();
    }
}

Guess the output of the above program & the execution order of the program.